# 基本文章編集 as a process (design 11.3, 11.2.6), for tools/ui_run.py: the 仮身操作,
# 実身操作 and 実行 of a link in the text, done by the shared part of lib/libtv (tv_vop.c).
# A copy of 基本文章編集 (mkbig doc) holds a text of two paragraphs, the first with a link
# to 実身/仮身 of the 原紙箱; it is opened with the process (pdoc). The menu is opened on the
# link (閉じる under the pointer at 230,135, its rows 20 apart: 仮身操作 200 below, 実身操作
# 220, 実行 320), and its 仮身操作, 実身操作 and 実行 shown; then once away from the link.
# The pictures of 実行 on the link and of the link carried out are the ones recorded before
# the text was moved to the shared part (dc_main.c called ta_exec_menu itself then). Those of
# 仮身操作 and 実身操作 are not: the text did none of their items then and left them all as
# the menu's definition has them, and now the shared part sets them for the link (閉じる
# grey, its object not open; 接続 and 起動アプリを最新にする hidden, the link reaching its
# object and keeping to no program). Then, in a new text, the items are done on the link
# picked: 属性変更, 続柄設定, 実身複製 and 新版作成 (the copies' links put right after the
# link), 起動アプリの固定 (the menu then offers 起動アプリを最新にする), and 実行's list.
# The message line (the bottom band) is left out: the shared part says what was done there.
# Keys: Esc 29, Enter 28, Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
waitwin 原紙箱
click 1000 48
wait 300
mkbig doc 1
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document>
xml <p>仮身の前<link id="019a6c9b-e67e-7a35-a461-0d199550e4cf_0.xtad" vobjid="01a10000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001" width="160" heightpx="19" chsz="14"/>仮身の後</p>
xml <p>後の段落</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 2
wait 800
# 仮身操作 on the link
logmark
click 230 135 1
expectsince document: exec menu on
expectsince document: menu
wait 1000
move 240 335
wait 150
move 300 335
wait 800
shot dv_vobj
shotsum dv_vobj 0 0 1280 780
want ok 4844429079828876
key 29
wait 200
key 29
wait 500
