drag 200 138 1000 560
expectsince document: link carried out (0)
wait 800
click 500 217
wait 300
move 690 490
wait 300
shot dv_out
shotsum dv_out 0 0 1280 780
want ok 8b4d48d18738c406
key 08 01
expect document: closed
wait 500
